<title>CANADA: Canada dlr closes stronger on trade numbers.</title>
<headline>Canada dlr closes stronger on trade numbers.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3460/1.3500	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3514</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3440  SUPPORT 1.3520	 HI 1.3594   LO  1.3473</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3508/45    HI 1.3598     EUROPE OPEN     1.3510</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3512/17    LO 1.3468     HI 1.3598   LO  1.3475</p>
<p>-----------------------MARKET COMMENT------------------------- * Canada's dollar closed stronger at C$1.3485 (US$0.7416) from Thursday's close of C$1.3512 (US$0.7401)</p>
<p>* The currency is rallying on a record trade surplus for Canada announced Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>* They said this week's cut in short-term interest rates by the Bank of Canada has also buoyed the unit.</p>
